{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"mermaid","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Mermaid","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Mermaid (.mmd .mermaid).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"mermaid","name":"Mermaid","extensions":[".mmd",".mermaid"],"grammar":"grammars/mermaid.json","lineComment":"%%"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Mermaid","path":"snippets/mermaid.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/mermaid.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"%%.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"-{1,2}>>?|<<?-{1,2}|={2,}>|-\\\\.+->|--[ox]|\\\\.\\\\.>|-\\\\)|--\\\\)|\\\\|[^|]*\\\\|\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][\\\\w]*(?=[\\\\[({>])\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\[[^\\\\]]*\\\\]|\\\\([^)]*\\\\)|\\\\{[^}]*\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:sequenceDiagram|stateDiagram-v2|quadrantChart|classDiagram|stateDiagram|participant|deactivate|autonumber|flowchart|erDiagram|direction|linkStyle|gitGraph|timeline|subgraph|activate|classDef|journey|mindmap|section|graph|gantt|actor|title|class|state|click|style|note|over|loop|else|rect|pie|end|alt|opt|par|and|as|of)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:TD|TB|BT|LR|RL)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/mermaid.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Flowchart\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"flow\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"flowchart ${1:TD}\",\n      \"  ${2:A}[${3:Start}] --> ${4:B}{${5:Decision}}\",\n      \"  ${4:B} -->|${6:yes}| ${7:C}[${8:Done}]\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A flowchart\"\n  },\n  \"Sequence diagram\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"seq\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"sequenceDiagram\",\n      \"  participant ${1:A}\",\n      \"  participant ${2:B}\",\n      \"  ${1:A}->>${2:B}: ${3:Hello}\",\n      \"  ${2:B}-->>${1:A}: ${4:Hi}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A sequence diagram\"\n  },\n  \"Class diagram\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"class\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"classDiagram\",\n      \"  class ${1:Animal} {\",\n      \"    +${2:String} ${3:name}\",\n      \"    +${4:speak}()\",\n      \"  }\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class diagram\"\n  },\n  \"ER diagram\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"er\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"erDiagram\",\n      \"  ${1:USER} ||--o{ ${2:ORDER} : places\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An ER diagram\"\n  },\n  \"Gantt\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"gantt\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"gantt\",\n      \"  title ${1:Plan}\",\n      \"  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\",\n      \"  section ${2:Phase}\",\n      \"  ${3:Task} :${4:a1}, ${5:2026-01-01}, ${6:7d}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Gantt chart\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Mermaid\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Mermaid.\n\n## Files\n\n`.mmd`, `.mermaid`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `%%`.\n- 5 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `flow` | A flowchart |\n| `seq` | A sequence diagram |\n| `class` | A class diagram |\n| `er` | An ER diagram |\n| `gantt` | A Gantt chart |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}